  "notes": "USAGE:\n{在位|ざいい} is used specifically for monarchs and sovereigns. It is not used for presidents or prime ministers (those use {在任|ざいにん} or {在職|ざいしょく}). In Japanese context, it is most commonly associated with the Emperor.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {在位|ざいい}{期間|きかん}: period of reign\n- {在位|ざいい}{中|ちゅう}: during the reign\n- {在位|ざいい}{年数|ねんすう}: number of years on the throne\n- {在位|ざいい}{最長|さいちょう}: longest reign",
